; Step IY to the next older phrase record, counting down B
;
; Counts one record off B, moves IY to the nearest older record that is not an
; EXCEPT record (#R$78A5) and leaves the old IY in IX (the swap is #R$7896).
; The mirror of #R$7892, which goes to newer records. Used by #R$75F6 to walk
; the records from the newest to the oldest.
;
; B Records left to visit
; IY Current record
; O:B Decreased by one
; O:IY The next older record
; O:IX The old IY
@label=StepOlderCount
c$788C DEC B         ;
 $788D CALL $78A5    ; FindOlderRecord: IX = the older record
 $7890 JR $7896      ; swap IX and IY
